# Tooling scratch directory, not part of the project.
.remember/

# The external design-system handoff, vendored verbatim as the visual source of
# truth. Its token CSS is minified by the design tooling and its markdown is
# authored; reformatting either would make it stop matching what the designer
# shipped, and diffing an updated bundle would become impossible.
design/

# The adopted copy of that token layer. It has to stay byte-identical to
# design/system/tokens/, because that is what makes the parity test in
# tests/integration/design/ mean anything: Prettier normalises `.06` to `0.06`
# and re-spaces every shadow value, and once the two copies differ
# cosmetically nobody can see whether they also differ substantively.
src/styles/tokens/
src/styles/global.css

# Per-machine Claude Code state, written by the tool rather than authored here.
# Ignored globally by git on the machine that produces it, which Prettier does
# not read - so without this line `pnpm check` fails on a file that is not part
# of the project.
.claude/settings.local.json
